+  // that keeps failing there is a fault that a restart should surface. The
+  // AuraDE host session runs on whatever it was installed on, and a GPU that
+  // is present and then fails every time, such as a virtual GPU with no 3D
+  // behind it or a driver that has none, took the whole desktop down once the
